{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_43","type":"agent_message","text":"The gitlink sweep found one more gap: changed-scope diffing inherits `diff.ignoreSubmodules=all`. That setting can hide a committed dependency update and allow its old result to be carried. The findings are now four blockers covering alias detection, working-copy cleanliness, and changed-path completeness.\n"}}
